{"c":[{"name":"20261021T200533Z-dc75d974ecb1c63f","text":"2026-10-21: deleting embeddings rows with the HNSW index up leaks one index copy at checkpoint or process close, on DuckDB 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. A no-match delete does not. The drop covers those deletes, not only inserts.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T202433Z-25b36bcacf2f9117","text":"2026-10-21 eleventh L4 preflight PASS WITH ADVISORY. Drop, delete, recreate, checkpoint keeps HNSW used blocks flat on DuckDB 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Advisories unadopted: checkpoint while the index is down; ingest keeps the index down for the whole process.","type":"note"}]}
